

<html lang="en" xmlns:b="http://www.google.com/2005/gml/b" xmlns:data="http://www.google.com/2005/gml/data" xmlns:expr="http://www.google.com/2005/gml/expr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"></meta>
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=0" name="viewport"></meta>
    <title>Page</title>
    
    <b:skin>&lt;![CDATA[
        /* යටින් තියෙන බ්ලොගර් කෑලි හැකිතාක් හයිඩ් කරලා දානවා */
        #navbar-iframe, .navbar, .header-outer, .footer-outer, .sidebar-container, .mobile-header {
            display: none !important;
            visibility: hidden !important;
        }
    ]]&gt;</b:skin>

    <style>
        /* බ්ලොගර් එකේ හැම රෙද්දකටම උඩින් 100% Screen එක වැහෙන්න හදන ප්ලේට් එක */
        .super-wrapper {
            position: fixed !important;
            top: 0 !important;
            left: 0 !important;
            width: 100vw !important;
            height: 100vh !important;
            background-color: #f4f4f4 !important;
            z-index: 999999999999 !important; /* මේකෙන් ලෝකේ තියෙන හැම එකටම උඩින් ඔයාගේ පේජ් එක එනවා */
            overflow-y: auto !important;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .button-container {
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 200px;
        }

        .red-button {
            background-color: #ff3923;
            color: white;
        }

        .green-button {
            background-color: #21eb75;
            color: white;
        }

        .blue-button {
            background-color: #27a9ff;
            color: white;
        }

        button:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        button:disabled {
            opacity: 0.5;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        .copyrighttext{
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    
    <div style="display: none !important;">
        <b:section id="main" maxwidgets="1" showaddelement="no">
            <b:widget id="Blog1" locked="true" title="Blog Posts" type="Blog" visible="false">
        </b:widget></b:section>
    </div>

    <div class="super-wrapper">
        
        <div class="description">
            <b><p>සයිට් එක ගොඩක් බිසී නිසා අපි ලින්ක් තුනක් දාලා තියෙන්නේ <br /><br /> ලින්ක් එකක් වැඩ කරේ නැති උනොත් <br /><br /> ඊලග ලින්ක් එකෙන් යන්න <br /><br />කෙලින්ම කතාවට යයි</p></b>
        </div>

        <div class="button-container">
            <button class="red-button" onclick="handleButtonClick()">ලින්ක් - 01</button>
            <button class="green-button" onclick="handleButtonClick()">ලින්ක් - 02</button>
            <button class="blue-button" onclick="handleButtonClick()">ලින්ක් - 03</button>
        </div>

        <div class="description">
            <b><p class="copyrighttext">Zapa whotta Team ©</p></b>
        </div>

    </div>

   <script>
    const thirdRedirectUrl = "https://fsbooknew.blogspot.com/2026/06/gurage-sellama.html";
    const disableTime = 3000; 

    function handleButtonClick() {
        let clickCount = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('clickCount')) || 0;

        const buttons = document.querySelectorAll("button");
        buttons.forEach(button => button.disabled = true);
        setTimeout(() => {
            buttons.forEach(button => button.disabled = false);
        }, disableTime);

        if (clickCount === 0 || clickCount === 1) {
            window.location.href = firstRedirectUrl;
        } else if (clickCount === 2) {
            window.location.href = thirdRedirectUrl;
        }

        clickCount = (clickCount + 1) % 3; 
        localStorage.setItem('clickCount', clickCount);
    }
</script>
    <script src="https://dexamax.github.io/videx/zaap.js"></script>
</body>
